<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Vitafoam full-year profit falls.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Vitafoam full-year profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year result for foam manufacturer Vitafoam Nigeria Plc to end-September.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				     1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover			  1,300   vs 1,000</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	  132.8 vs   158.0</p>
<p>Taxation			     41.4 vs    69.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	    91.4 vs    98.8</p>
<p>Dividend per share	    35 kobo vs 25 kobo</p>
<p>Payment date - March 28, 1997.</p>
<p>Closure of register - Between February 24, 1997 and February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
